wikiskill CLI backend (unofficial)
==================================

This project is an independent implementation of an execution backend for the
WikiSkill self-evolving skill loop. It contains no code copied from WikiSkill.

Upstream references
-------------------
* Paper:  "WikiSkill" — arXiv:2608.27454
* Project: https://github.com/ashutoshsinghpr7/wikiskill (PyPI: wikiskill)

The AgentBackend protocol implemented here (profile_dir / env /
bootstrap_profile / set_active_skills / patch_model / run / export_session)
and the session-transcript contract consumed by the upstream gating step are
derived from the above public project and its paper. No license is declared in
the upstream repository as of this writing, therefore no upstream files are
redistributed; only the protocol shape is re-implemented.

This backend is not affiliated with or endorsed by the WikiSkill authors.
If you redistribute it, keep this file so users can tell which project is
which.
